{"id":"tortue","lemma":"tortue","pos":"noun","rank":3724,"glosses":["turtle or tortoise"],"ipa":"/tɔʁ.ty/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/11/Fr-tortue.ogg/Fr-tortue.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tortues"},"formAudio":{"tortues":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-tortues.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J’aime les tortues.","en":"I like turtles.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Les tortues ont-elles des dents ?","en":"Do turtles have teeth?","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"they"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"tooth","l":"dent"}]},{"text":"Les tortues vivent généralement longtemps.","en":"Turtles usually live a long time.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to live","l":"vivre"},{"g":"generally, in general"},{"g":"for a long time"}]},{"text":"Les tortues hibernent.","en":"Turtles hibernate.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,null]},{"text":"La tortue de mer a pondu ses œufs sur la plage.","en":"The sea turtle laid its eggs on the beach.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"sea"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to lay","l":"pondre"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"egg","l":"œuf"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"beach"}]}]}